#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:9
msgid "F479 QuadSPI 与串行 NOR"
msgstr "F479 QuadSPI and serial NOR"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:11
msgid ""
"本页限定于已维护的F479与W25Q128JV软件配置；并行存储、SDRAM与图形bank归[外部存储合同](f4-external-"
"memory.md)。"
msgstr ""
"This page is limited to the maintained F479 and W25Q128JV software "
"configurations. Parallel storage, SDRAM, and graphics banks belong to the "
"[external memory contract](f4-external-memory.md)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:13
msgid "间接访问与串行 NOR"
msgstr "Indirect access and serial NOR"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:15
msgid ""
"首个软件参考固定 `STM32F479NIH6`、QUADSPI Flash1 和 `W25Q128JV`，控制器 "
"`external_bus/qspi-indirect-sdr` 与既有 `flash_async-endpoint/nor-indirect` "
"保持独立身份、共享同一 C owner。此处仅支持 1-1-1 SDR、24 bit 地址、READ03、 256 B page program 和 4"
" KiB erase；16 MiB 物理几何以单个 erase span 表达。 `base_address=0` 只描述未映射的物理地址，不授予 "
"CPU 映射。物理 Flash 的 `erase_spans` 完整覆盖容量，checked sector 查询不向下舍入、不保留展开表；失败不 "
"修改查询输出。产品分区仍由外部工程明确声明，不能把 geometry 当作分区政策。 同步 Flash face 只提供有界读／几何／恢复， "
"写擦通过调用者持有的有限请求和显式 task `service` 推进，不新增驱动线程或队列。"
msgstr ""
"The initial software reference fixes `STM32F479NIH6`, QUADSPI Flash1 and "
"`W25Q128JV`. The `external_bus/qspi-indirect-sdr` controller and existing "
"`flash_async-endpoint/nor-indirect` keep separate identities while sharing "
"one C owner. This slice supports 1-1-1 SDR, 24-bit addresses, READ03, "
"256-byte page program and 4 KiB erase only. One erase span describes the 16 "
"MiB physical geometry. `base_address=0` describes an unmapped physical "
"address without granting CPU mapping. Physical Flash `erase_spans` cover the"
" entire capacity. Checked sector queries do not round down or retain an "
"expanded table, and failure leaves outputs unchanged. Products still declare"
" their own regions; geometry is not partition policy. The synchronous Flash "
"face provides bounded read/geometry/recovery only. Caller-owned finite "
"requests and explicit task `service` advance writes/erases without adding a "
"driver thread or queue."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:25
msgid ""
"`qspi-indirect-sdr` 使用 PIO；另一个显式控制器模式 `qspi-indirect-dma` 仅把有限 page program "
"的数据阶段交给 DMA。两者均保留上述只读同步 face、有限写擦请求、 1-1-1 命令和同一 controller "
"owner；读取、状态和写后校验继续使用 PIO。 DMA 模式不新增异步读取合同、后台 worker、队列或缓冲区复制。"
msgstr ""
"`qspi-indirect-sdr` uses PIO. A separate explicit controller mode, `qspi-"
"indirect-dma`, delegates only the data phase of finite page programming to "
"DMA. Both retain the readonly synchronous face, finite program/erase "
"requests, 1-1-1 commands and the same controller owner described above. "
"Reads, status and post-write verification remain PIO. DMA mode adds no "
"asynchronous-read contract, background worker, queue or buffer copy."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:30
msgid ""
"完整官方 HAL command／receive／transmit／IRQ／abort transport 在该 task 中推进， QUADSPI "
"和所选 DMA 向量始终保持 NVIC 禁用。每个 Handle 的回调 ABI 固定为 1，厂商类型 保留在私有头；官方 HAL DMA 实现由所选 "
"target 共享一次，不以测试 stub 代替。 Nexus 在交出缓冲区之前读回实际 CCR／AR／DLR，防止 HAL 从错误 DLR "
"扩展访问范围。 HAL 回调、CPU 数据退出、控制器 ABORT／FIFO／IRQ join、外部 Flash WIP 清零是不同 "
"事实；当前单元读回确认之后才增加完成前缀。全 `0xff` 输入不发 program 脉冲。"
msgstr ""
"The complete official HAL command/receive/transmit/IRQ/abort transport "
"advances in that task. QUADSPI and the selected DMA vector remain NVIC-"
"disabled throughout. Each Handle fixes its callback ABI to 1, and vendor "
"types stay in private headers. The selected target shares one official HAL "
"DMA implementation rather than a test stub. Before handing over buffers, "
"Nexus verifies actual CCR/AR/DLR readback to prevent HAL from extending "
"access through an incorrect DLR. HAL callbacks, CPU data withdrawal, "
"controller ABORT/FIFO/IRQ joins and external Flash WIP clearance are "
"separate facts. The completed prefix advances only after readback verifies "
"the current unit. All-`0xff` input issues no program pulse."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:37
msgid ""
"DMA 模式按 RM0386 Table30 独占 DMA2 Stream7 Channel3，Platform 持有共享 DMA2 "
"clock。生成器只连接可选状态和只读内存域，PIO 不分配 DMA 运行状态；CMake 只在 选择该模式时编译 DMA "
"扩展。编程请求的完整输入必须在准入前通过所选主 SRAM 或 只读内部 Flash 域检查，CCM、未授权外部窗口和覆盖 "
"owner／配置的缓冲区均拒绝。 HAL 提交后分别读回稳定的地址、方向和模式；NDTR 允许真实递减，不能超出已借用 长度，EN=0 "
"还须有完整传输计数与本轮 TC，不能将任意关闭当作完成。"
msgstr ""
"Following RM0386 Table30, DMA mode exclusively owns DMA2 Stream7 Channel3; "
"Platform holds the shared DMA2 clock. The generator connects only optional "
"state and readonly memory domains. PIO allocates no mutable DMA state, and "
"CMake compiles the DMA extension only when this mode is selected. Before "
"admission, the complete programming input must pass checks against the "
"selected main-SRAM or readonly internal-Flash domains. CCM, unauthorized "
"external windows and buffers overlapping owner/configuration storage are "
"rejected. After HAL submission, stable addresses, direction and mode are "
"checked independently. NDTR may decrease as real transfers progress, but "
"cannot exceed the borrowed length. EN=0 additionally requires a completed "
"transfer count and TC from the current transfer; arbitrary disable is not "
"completion."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:44
msgid ""
"task `service` 先推进官方 DMA handler，再推进 QSPI handler。DMA TC 只说明内存 传输阶段结束；QSPI "
"BUSY／FIFO 退出、NOR WIP 清零和写后验证完成之后，才能发布 SETTLED。停止先撤回 QSPI 请求源，再观察 stream "
"EN=0，清地址、计数、标志与 pending， 撤回 HAL 回调和缓冲指针；清理被拒绝时继续保留输入和请求。停止预算到期进入 "
"QUARANTINED，后续显式重试实际 join，不重放 page program 或重置共享 DMA2。 两种模式的软件参考分别见 [PIO "
"装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi.toml) 与 [编程 DMA"
" 装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-dma.toml)。"
msgstr ""
"Task `service` advances the official DMA handler before the QSPI handler. "
"DMA TC establishes only completion of the memory-transfer phase. SETTLED is "
"published only after QSPI BUSY/FIFO exit, NOR WIP clearance and post-write "
"verification. Stop first withdraws QSPI requests, then observes stream EN=0,"
" clears addresses, counts, flags and pending state, and detaches HAL "
"callbacks and buffer pointers. Rejected cleanup continues to retain the "
"input and request. Expiry of the stop budget enters QUARANTINED. Later "
"explicit retries must perform the actual join, without replaying page "
"programming or resetting shared DMA2. Software references for the two modes "
"are the [PIO assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-"
"qspi.toml) and [program-DMA assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-dma.toml)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:53
msgid ""
"取消或 deadline 阻止下一脉冲，不能撤销已发生的写擦；中途 ABORT 仍可能启动部分 page "
"program。请求／输入持续借用，直到控制器和器件实际退出并发布 SETTLED。 清源或退出被拒绝时保留同一请求和冷态责任；重试必须完成真实 "
"join，不能只清软件 active，也不能把 service 一次成功推进误报为 recover 已完成。首个错误保留， "
"已经确认的前缀单独报告。`flash_async.stop` 只封闭新请求并取消／排空当前请求， 保留 bank、配置、时钟与同步只读 "
"face；失败退出保持 QUARANTINED 借用，不能冒报 已完成。只有 Platform 的冷停止才能归还控制器资源。任何停止都不能越过未结清 "
"请求或重置共享 DMA／外来控制器。"
msgstr ""
"Cancellation or a deadline prevents the next pulse but cannot undo a "
"write/erase already started. Mid-operation ABORT may still launch a partial "
"page program. The request/input remain borrowed until the controller and "
"device actually exit and SETTLED is published. Refused source withdrawal or "
"join retains the same request and cold responsibility. Retry must complete a"
" real join, not merely clear software active state or report one successful "
"service step as completed recovery. The first error is retained and the "
"confirmed prefix is reported separately. `flash_async.stop` closes new "
"admission and cancels/drains the active request while retaining the bank, "
"configuration, clocks and synchronous readonly face. Failed withdrawal "
"retains QUARANTINED borrows and cannot claim completion. Only Platform cold "
"stop releases controller resources. No stop bypasses an unsettled request or"
" resets shared DMA/foreign controllers."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:62
msgid ""
"端点显式提供 prescaler、NCS 高电平周期数和读／准备／停止预算；配置与 C 均审核 READ03 不超过 50 MHz、NCS 高电平至少 "
"50 ns，并使用原 System 时间域。四个已审 SoC pad 不证明 PCB：外部集成须提供额定稳定电源与上电准备，WP#／HOLD# 或确切 "
"后缀的 RESET# 处于数据手册允许的非活动状态。软件不自动修改保护、QE、QPI、 DDR 或复位器件，也不推断具体 Flash "
"封装／后缀已经实装。"
msgstr ""
"The endpoint explicitly supplies prescaler, NCS-high cycles and "
"read/prepare/stop budgets. Configuration and C both check READ03≤50MHz, NCS "
"high≥50ns and the original System time domain. Four reviewed SoC pads do not"
" prove PCB wiring. External integration supplies rated stable power, power-"
"up readiness and the permitted inactive levels for WP#/HOLD# or the exact "
"suffix's RESET#. Software does not silently change protection, QE, QPI or "
"DDR, reset the device or infer an installed Flash package/suffix."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:68
msgid "F479 选定 Quad Read"
msgstr "Selected F479 Quad Read"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:70
msgid ""
"端点模式 `nor-indirect-quad-read` 显式选择 `W25Q128JVSIQ` 软件参考，保留同一 QUADSPI "
"owner，可与上述 PIO 或有限 program-DMA 控制器模式组合。硬件路线增加 PF7／IO2 AF9 和 PF6／IO3 AF9，共六个 "
"pad。DS11118 Rev8 Table10／12 证明精确 F479NI 封装的 bonding 和 AF，不证明 PCB 接线或实际 Flash"
" 后缀。"
msgstr ""
"Endpoint mode `nor-indirect-quad-read` explicitly selects the `W25Q128JVSIQ`"
" software reference, retaining the same QUADSPI owner, and can be combined "
"with the PIO or finite program-DMA controller modes above. The hardware "
"route adds PF7／IO2 AF9 and PF6／IO3 AF9 for a total of six pads. DS11118 Rev8"
" Table10／12 establish bonding and AF for the exact F479NI package; they do "
"not establish PCB wiring or the actual Flash suffix."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:75
msgid ""
"Winbond W25Q128JV RevM（2024-12-24）§7.1.4 规定 IQ 选项 QE 固定为 1。 冷准备在单线 JEDEC "
"probe 后只读 SR2，观察 QE=1、SUS=0 才发布 PREPARED；QE=0 或已有挂起操作均拒绝，保留实际冷清理责任，不修改 "
"status、保护、供电或复位策略， 也不自动恢复外来挂起脉冲。JEDEC `EF4018` 不能单独证明 SIQ 订货号；实际器件声明和 "
"IO2／IO3 连接由外部集成负责，不能继续 将这两个 pad 按旧 WP#／HOLD# 功能固定在非活动电平。"
msgstr ""
"Winbond W25Q128JV RevM (2024-12-24) §7.1.4 specifies that QE is fixed at 1 "
"for the IQ option. After a single-line JEDEC probe, cold preparation only "
"reads SR2 and publishes PREPARED only after observing QE=1, SUS=0. QE=0 or "
"an existing suspended operation is rejected, retaining actual cold-cleanup "
"responsibility without changing status, protection, power or reset policy, "
"or automatically resuming a foreign suspended pulse. JEDEC `EF4018` alone "
"cannot establish the SIQ order code; external integration is responsible for"
" the actual device declaration and IO2／IO3 wiring. These two pads must no "
"longer be strapped to inactive levels for their former WP#／HOLD# functions."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:82
msgid ""
"生成配置在编译期选择 `NEXUS_QSPI_QUAD_READ`，不增加运行时模式标志、最大状态 或另一层转发。同步只读 face 使用 "
"6Bh、24-bit 单线地址、8 个 dummy clocks 和 四线数据；写后 verify、status 和 02h program "
"保持单线。数据仍由 PIO 处理， 默认只读 owner 的可变布局不增字段；增加的两份 GPIO 快照只属于所选六 pad 路线。 当前继续限制 "
"SCK 不超过 50 MHz，每个底层读事务最多 32 字节，保留原有限 deadline 检查和实际 ABORT／FIFO／BUSY "
"收口。四线数据相位不等于端到端吞吐已经提升四倍， 命令、dummy、分段和 CPU 处理仍有代价，实际吞吐必须另行测量。"
msgstr ""
"Generated configuration selects `NEXUS_QSPI_QUAD_READ` at compile time, "
"adding no runtime mode flag, maximum-sized state or extra forwarding layer. "
"The synchronous read-only face uses 6Bh, a 24-bit single-line address, 8 "
"dummy clocks and four data lines; post-write verify, status and 02h program "
"remain single-line. Data still uses PIO, and no fields are added to the "
"default read-only owner's mutable layout; the two additional GPIO snapshots "
"belong only to the selected six-pad route. SCK remains limited to 50 MHz and"
" each hardware read transaction to 32 bytes, retaining the original finite "
"deadline checks and actual ABORT／FIFO／BUSY closure. A four-line data phase "
"does not establish a fourfold increase in end-to-end throughput: command, "
"dummy, segmentation and CPU processing still have costs, and actual "
"throughput requires separate measurement."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:90
msgid ""
"ES0321 §2.4.1 的额外 FIFO 条件同时要求 quad、DDR 和 AHB/2；本模式核对 DDRM=0 并继续执行完整 "
"FIFO／ABORT 退出。§2.4.2 的写入 dummy 问题不因读命令 的 dummy 而适用：02h program 仍为 "
"dummy=0，不增加 quad-program 命令。 6Bh 的 CCR／AR／DLR 必须在提供输出指针前全部读回一致；失败或超时的返回不得 "
"继续访问调用者输出，未完成的硬件清理仍保留原 owner。"
msgstr ""
"The additional FIFO condition in ES0321 §2.4.1 requires quad, DDR and AHB/2 "
"together; this mode checks DDRM=0 and continues to perform complete "
"FIFO／ABORT withdrawal. The write-dummy issue in §2.4.2 does not apply merely"
" because a read command uses dummy clocks: 02h program retains dummy=0, and "
"no quad-program command is added. All 6Bh CCR／AR／DLR readbacks must match "
"before the output pointer is supplied; after a failure or timeout return, "
"the caller's output must no longer be accessed, while unfinished hardware "
"cleanup remains with the original owner."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:96
msgid ""
"软件参考分别为 [Quad PIO 装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-"
"quad.toml) 和 [Quad Read＋program DMA 装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-quad-dma.toml)。"
" 它们不启用 quad program、QPI／DDR、dual Flash、映射或 XIP。"
msgstr ""
"The software references are the [Quad PIO "
"assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-quad.toml) and "
"the [Quad Read＋program DMA assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-quad-dma.toml)."
" They do not enable quad program, QPI／DDR, dual Flash, mapping or XIP."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:100
msgid ""
"ES0321 §2.4.5 进一步要求 整个 provider 生命周期都禁止访问 `0x90000000` aperture，包括其它 "
"CPU、IRQ、 DMA 和调试访问；仅不返回 mapped pointer 不足以满足约束。精确物理验收保持 `not_executed`，模型与 "
"ARM 软件证据不替代电气／时序／实物验证。实现见 [QuadSPI 私有合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/memory/stm32f4_qspi.h)。"
msgstr ""
"ES0321 §2.4.5 further requires all access to the `0x90000000` aperture to be"
" prohibited throughout the provider lifetime, including other CPU, IRQ, DMA "
"and debug accesses; merely withholding a mapped pointer does not satisfy "
"this constraint. Exact physical acceptance remains `not_executed`; model and"
" ARM software evidence do not replace electrical／timing／physical validation."
" See the [private QuadSPI contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/drivers/memory/stm32f4_qspi.h) for the "
"implementation."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:106
msgid "F479 CPU_READ 映射端点"
msgstr "F479 CPU_READ mapped endpoint"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:108
msgid ""
"`mapped_storage/nor-mapped-cpu` 是独立端点，固定同一 `STM32F479NIH6`、`W25Q128JVSIQ` "
"和六个已审 pad。控制器仍选择 `qspi-indirect-sdr`，不与 program-DMA 组合；读取采用 6Bh、24 bit 地址和八个"
" dummy 时钟。该模式不导出 Flash／FlashAsync 旁路 face，也不授予 XIP、DMA reader、DDR、QPI、quad "
"program 或写窗口。原间接 Flash 模式继续禁止所有 aperture 访问。"
msgstr ""
"`mapped_storage/nor-mapped-cpu` is a distinct endpoint for the same exact "
"`STM32F479NIH6`, `W25Q128JVSIQ` and six reviewed pads. Its controller "
"remains `qspi-indirect-sdr` and does not combine with program DMA; reads use"
" 6Bh, a 24-bit address and eight dummy clocks. This mode exposes no "
"Flash/FlashAsync bypass face and grants no XIP, DMA reader, DDR, QPI, quad "
"program or writable window. The original indirect Flash modes continue to "
"forbid all aperture access."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:110
msgid ""
"配置显式提供 `parameters.read_slots=1..8`。生成器仅为选中实例分配静态 composite、通用 owner 和确切数量的 "
"reader slots，并通过 `nx_factory_mapped_storage_ref` 返回既有公共 "
"face。未选模式不增加这些对象、组件头或链接依赖。CPU reader 只能访问 loan 授权的范围，必须先完成读取与 release；最后一个 "
"release 证明映射退出后，有限间接请求或冷停止才可继续。失败保留 loan 和清理责任，不能提前重用 storage。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration explicitly supplies `parameters.read_slots=1..8`. The "
"generator allocates a static composite, generic owner and exact reader-slot "
"count only for a selected instance, and `nx_factory_mapped_storage_ref` "
"returns its existing public face. Unselected modes add none of these "
"objects, component headers or link dependencies. A CPU reader may access "
"only the range granted by its loan and must join its reads and release. "
"Finite indirect requests or cold stop proceed only after the final release "
"proves mapping withdrawal. Failure retains the loan and cleanup "
"responsibility; storage cannot be reused early."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:112
msgid ""
"release 失败后，调用者已完成的 CPU 读取不得继续；保留 loan 只表示清理责任仍在， 不授予继续访问。仅原 System "
"`time_epoch` 仍有效、受支持时钟条件恢复后才可重试 release；若 epoch 已改变而旧 loan 未 "
"join，必须保持隔离并由产品恢复或复位，不能 回滚 epoch 使旧 token 复活。平台不承诺自动恢复。"
msgstr ""
"After release fails, the caller must not resume CPU reads that it has "
"already joined. A retained loan preserves cleanup responsibility and grants "
"no continued access. Release may be retried only while the original System "
"`time_epoch` remains valid and the supported clock conditions have been "
"restored. If the epoch has changed before an old loan is joined, keep it "
"isolated and use product recovery or reset; never roll back the epoch to "
"revive an old token. The platform promises no automatic recovery."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/f479-qspi.md:117
msgid ""
"ES0321 §2.4.3 要求先完成状态读取、将 AR 置零，并在前一次 indirect read 后证明 ABORT／BUSY／FIFO "
"完整退出；此后不再写 DR，才进入映射。§2.4.4 的 timeout counter 和 timeout IRQ 始终禁用，最后一个 CPU "
"reader 退出后经同 CPU 屏障和有界 ABORT 撤回映射，并读回实际 FMODE。§2.4.5 的间接阶段 aperture "
"禁令保持。调用者必须排除其他 DMA、调试器及外来 master；reader 标签不构成总线防火墙。软件参考见 "
"[映射装配](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-"
"map.toml)，不证明实装器件、PCB 或 HIL。"
msgstr ""
"ES0321 §2.4.3 requires status reads to finish, AR to be zero, and complete "
"ABORT/BUSY/FIFO withdrawal after the previous indirect read; no further DR "
"write occurs before entering mapped mode. Under §2.4.4, the timeout counter "
"and timeout IRQ remain disabled. After the final CPU reader joins, same-CPU "
"barriers and a bounded ABORT withdraw mapping, and the actual FMODE is read "
"back. The §2.4.5 aperture ban remains in the indirect phase. The caller must"
" exclude other DMA, debuggers and foreign masters; reader tags are no bus "
"firewall. The [mapped assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/integration/assemblies/stm32f4_qspi/f479ni-qspi-map.toml) is a "
"software reference and proves neither fitted parts, PCB wiring nor HIL."
